    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/2ac20baf7df55475dd1ae0490bdbc13f.avif?t=1728937720\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blooming</strong> is a <strong>2D platformer action game</strong> with a pixel art/retro style. You play as Rose, a student at Bastion wizardry academy; which has been invaded by a monster army send by non other than your own god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore different areas of the school, every one of them with a unique theme based on elements. Defeat each zone\u00b4s boss in any order you want, for you to gain their power and confront <strong>\u201cThe Heavenly Creator\u201d</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side scrolling platforming</strong> and action. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat inspired by classics:</strong> you have a bow that can be turned into dual blades. Attack either at close distance or range. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c613c4bbe2c713f2673d895294436261.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c613c4bbe2c713f2673d895294436261.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c613c4bbe2c713f2673d895294436261.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental arrows system:</strong> by defeating bosses you can unlock their powers in the form of an elemental arrow. You can change your active arrow at any moment. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/024f810cfdff799d64266068024cc5d9.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/024f810cfdff799d64266068024cc5d9.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/024f810cfdff799d64266068024cc5d9.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses and areas can be explored in any order</strong>,  but maybe you can use one element to defeat another\u2026 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/45952826fbe518813b469ebf92ce3ea1.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/45952826fbe518813b469ebf92ce3ea1.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/45952826fbe518813b469ebf92ce3ea1.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and defeat optional bosses:</strong> these bosses will upgrade the arrow from the boss of their specific zone. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can jump and use a dash</strong>, use these tools to fight and move around levels efficiently. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/dbb5096ae4474f50c66444e1fe3d1fc9.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/dbb5096ae4474f50c66444e1fe3d1fc9.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/dbb5096ae4474f50c66444e1fe3d1fc9.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need healing or ammo?:</strong> defeat enemies to gain spirit and spend it according to your situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must adapt and think:</strong> you use the same resource to heal and replenish ammo. To earn it you must fight, not hide.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/2ac20baf7df55475dd1ae0490bdbc13f.avif?t=1728937720\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blooming</strong> is a <strong>2D platformer action game</strong> with a pixel art/retro style. You play as Rose, a student at Bastion wizardry academy; which has been invaded by a monster army send by non other than your own god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore different areas of the school, every one of them with a unique theme based on elements. Defeat each zone\u00b4s boss in any order you want, for you to gain their power and confront <strong>\u201cThe Heavenly Creator\u201d</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side scrolling platforming</strong> and action. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c6335eeff0e92b77107cdc1bf08d555f.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat inspired by classics:</strong> you have a bow that can be turned into dual blades. Attack either at close distance or range. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/c613c4bbe2c713f2673d895294436261.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><sou