at optional bosses:</strong> these bosses will upgrade the arrow from the boss of their specific zone. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/cf6ac5fd8ee99fb244152435f40a5444.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can jump and use a dash</strong>, use these tools to fight and move around levels efficiently. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/dbb5096ae4474f50c66444e1fe3d1fc9.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/dbb5096ae4474f50c66444e1fe3d1fc9.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/dbb5096ae4474f50c66444e1fe3d1fc9.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need healing or ammo?:</strong> defeat enemies to gain spirit and spend it according to your situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/8f2a2582780edf9221cba612752e3917.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must adapt and think:</strong> you use the same resource to heal and replenish ammo. To earn it you must fight, not hide.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.poster.avif?t=1728937720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.webm?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530280/extras/9d70f5c45dc93eaf908d2ba51d1e2984.mp4?t=1728937720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
